{"id":1496696,"imdb":"tt9213874","en":"Breeder","orig":"Breeder","ar":null,"tag":"Perfection has its price.","ov":"في إطار من الرعب والتشويق، تستدرج مربية كلاب غريبة الأطوار تُدعى \"باتي\" طالبًا جامعيًا باحثًا يعاني من ضائقة مالية إلى مزرعتها النائية والمعزولة، بعدما تعده بتمويل أبحاثه لإنقاذ النحل. لكن سرعان ما يكتشف الشاب أن طموحات المربية تتجاوز إنقاذ النحل بكثير، وأن لهذا العرض السخي ثمنًا مرعبًا ومظلمًا يضعه في فخ يصعب الفرار منه.","rd":"2026-10-28","rt":97,"g":[27,53],"lang":"en","budget":2000000,"revenue":808283,"companies":[{"n":"Rabbits Black","logo":"/vF5HUjsJU0jFtlhpUdcodrECXBk.png","c":"US"},{"n":"Hadron Films","logo":null,"c":"CA"},{"n":"Mitchell & Start Films","logo":null,"c":"US"},{"n":"Four J Films","logo":null,"c":"US"}],"countries":["US","CA"],"langs":["English"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"PL","d":"2026-08-13"},{"c":"ES","d":"2026-10-13"},{"c":"US","d":"2026-10-28"},{"c":"NZ","d":"2026-10-30"}],"dir":["Alex Goyette"],"prod":["Chris Wilkinson","Byron Austen Ashley","K. Asher Levin","Brian Mitchell","Ian Start"],"wri":["Alex Goyette"],"mus":["Hannah Parrott"],"dop":["Jaryl Lim"],"cast":[{"n":"Daniel Doheny","ch":"Russell","p":"/wRmWiPx9X2IozM0EZNeOHs2VT18.jpg"},{"n":"Dot-Marie Jones","ch":"Patti Kolb","p":"/p6Lg9p6Y9IGlYjv2VEaGb4dvoWm.jpg"},{"n":"Maddie Phillips","ch":"Ainsley Kolb","p":"/uuQBuEdkhgDSJ2wnE5N4tyryl4t.jpg"},{"n":"Tanaya Beatty","ch":"Haley","p":"/nQQd9rpMxYM2MshYlOSV0PfffPP.jpg"},{"n":"Lillian Doucet-Roche","ch":"Yara Kolb","p":"/nspOpe1oXYpqSjEFd6Gebe5UKAl.jpg"},{"n":"Isla Spencer","ch":"Manon Kolb","p":"/jqgjA4CPYxZSIm911Cg2GSeJEgd.jpg"},{"n":"Paige McGarvin","ch":"Cosette Kolb","p":"/uje6RhaW8fengmdf8WEWYvT5sH7.jpg"},{"n":"John Murphy","ch":"Officer Morgan","p":"/kRizKtn3RWdiKG9NoFynid62bLg.jpg"},{"n":"Rochelle Greenwood","ch":"Cindy","p":"/1AsN5UFwBRibQJqKNhczDQlV7M9.jpg"},{"n":"Carmen Moore","ch":"Angela","p":"/cPUNFyRPEbgNpBfEVYKWNZtoGML.jpg"},{"n":"Kathleen Duborg","ch":"Connie","p":"/y2ydKXs8ORtwKsbq1gPXfcvvnGG.jpg"},{"n":"Matthe